  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nIn the [Rendering chapter](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/rendering.html#phrasing-content-3), `<br>`  and `<wbr>` are specified with the `display-outside` property which has been [removed from css-display-3](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-display-3/#:~:text=Changes%20since%20the%2011%20September%202014%20Working%20Draft) quite a while ago in favor of multi-valued `display`, and has not (yet) been added back in Level 4 either. \n\n~~~~ css\nbr { display-outside: newline; } /* this also has bidi implications */\nwbr { display-outside: break-opportunity; } /* this also has bidi implications */\n~~~~\n\nI’m not quite sure what the best replacement is, though. ",
